WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Nisela umbhede kahle ngaphambi kokufaka i-mulch.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Sakaza utshani obomile noma enye i-mulch emaholoholo phezu komhlabathi.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:21.000
I-mulch mayibe ngu-5 kuya ku-10 cm. Utshani obusikiwe bube buncane.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:29.000
Shiya u-5 cm ungenayo i-mulch ezungeze iziqu zemifino ukuze zome.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Imvula ingena emhlabathini omboziwe. Umswakama uhlala isikhathi eside.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:43.000
Yengeze njengoba ibola. Gcina isikhala sizungeze iziqu.
